The build queue model, the package states including finished-but-blocked, the
blocking propagation, the supervisor/worker split and the "already built means
the asset exists" rule are adapted from msys2-autobuild:

    https://github.com/msys2/msys2-autobuild
    Copyright (c) msys2-autobuild contributors, MIT licensed

No code was copied. The Windows build layer, the six build types and the
dependency on a live web service to compute the queue have no counterpart
here: metadata comes from vita-makepkg --printsrcinfo instead.
